      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a way to cope, isn't it? like we're just making up little stories to keep ourselves from losing it. if you look at the actual scale of things, everything we care about is just noise. it feels more honest to just accept that it's all empty. it's exhausting trying to pretend there's some \"purpose\" when there really isn't.",
